          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiyakulwa naye ngesifo nangegazi; futhi ngiyonisa phezu kwakhe naphezu kwamabutho akhe naphezu kwabantu abaningi abakanye naye imvula namatshe esichotho esikhulu, umlilo nesibabule.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
